# Yasharn, Implacable Earth stops paying life to cast spells or activate abilities, but not a payment a resolving ability
# asks for (the ruling: "Other things may still cause players to pay life ... such as a resolving spell or ability"; CR
# 118.12). With Bot1's Yasharn on the battlefield, Bot2 targets Bot1's Gev, Scaled Scorch ("Ward--Pay 2 life") with
# Lightning Bolt and pays the 2 life as the ward trigger resolves: 20 to 18, the Bolt resolves and Gev, a 3/2, dies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Yasharn, Implacable Earth
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Gev, Scaled Scorch
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Yasharn, Implacable Earth.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Search()
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gev, Scaled Scorch.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Gev, Scaled Scorch)
Bot2.Accept
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Graveyard = Gev, Scaled Scorch; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Yasharn, Implacable Earth
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
